Homepage: https://github.com/sched-ext/scx-loader

Package: scx-tools
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, scx-scheds, polkitd
Description: D-Bus loader for sched_ext schedulers
 scx_loader starts, stops and switches the sched_ext schedulers of scx-scheds
 over D-Bus (org.scx.Loader) with a polkit policy, and scxctl and scxtui talk
 to it. The unit is installed and stays off until it is enabled.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski). Upstream: Vladislav Nepogodin and the scx-loader contributors.
